sbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KOJIMA, TOSHIHARU</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A demodulator comprises nonlinear processing means (20) for removing the modulated components from received baseband signals to obtain unmodulated complex data; first moving average means (25a) for determining the moving average of unmodulated complex data; means (24) for determining the carrier phase from the vector angle represented by the moving average; and means (5) for determining filter bandwidth to control the bandwidth of the first moving average means (25a) by using the data of past r symbols in unmodulated complex data.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Démodulateur qui comporte un moyen de traitement non linéaire (20) destiné à supprimer les composantes modulées de signaux dans la bande de base reçus, un premier dispositif (25a) destiné à déterminer la moyenne mobile de données complexes non modulées, un moyen (24) destiné à déterminer la phase de porteuse à partir de l'angle vectoriel représenté par la moyenne mobile et un moyen (5) permettant de déterminer la largeur de bande du filtre pour commander la largeur de bande du premier dispositif (25a) de détermination de la moyenne mobile à l'aide des données de symboles r précédents dans des données complexes non modulées.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>